::  modules/apps/linengrow/glow/fold-linengrow-consent.glow -- Consent gate
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-linengrow-consent
  |=  [uses-so-far=@ud max-uses=@ud promised-mala=@ud]  ::  bounded data grant
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  next permitted use
  ~|  'linengrow-zero-return-refused'                   ::  honest reciprocity
  ?>  (gte promised-mala 1)                             ::  >= 1 MALA promised
  ~|  'linengrow-use-cap-exhausted'                     ::  bounded consent!
  ?>  (lte +(uses-so-far) max-uses)                     ::  within use ceiling
  +(uses-so-far)
--
